    "  {\n",
    "   \"metadata\": {},\n",
    "   \"cell_type\": \"markdown\",\n",
    "   \"source\": \"The significance in `n_hidden` is lost if we subset to `n_hidden < 6` and is only significant for `cytof_init` if `n_hidden <= 6` (and for the worse) meaning the change we see in `multimodal` from 2 to 4 is not significant...\",\n",
